> briefly but again seems to be down)  if I wear the thing does it still
> confer magic resistance and faster energy regeneration as well as half
> damage when attacked by spells, or is that only if I carry it?

If it's in your main inventory (eg not in a sack or bag of holding)
then
you will get the benefits (magic resistance, faster energy regen and
spells only do half damage to you).  If you wear it, then you will gain

telepathy too.

>  Also I don't understand Invoked description:
> "Transports you to the closest visited level of any dungeon branch you
> have already visited."
> What exactly does that mean?  I'm on floor 9 right now.  If I invoke it
> what happens?  Where do I end up?  Will my Olog-hai come with me?
> Really I need a more detailed description with some examples.

When you #invoke it, a menu will come up asking "Open a portal to which

dungeon?" And should offer at least "The Dungeons of Doom", "Sokoban",
"The Gnomish Mines" and "The Quest".  Once you've made your choice, you

will be whisked away to that part of the dungeon.  If your Olog-hai is
next to you he should come along for the ride.

